The fastloess C++ library is available through the upstream CMake package:

    find_package(fastloess CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE fastloess::fastloess)

Include <fastloess.hpp> to use the C++17 interface.
The curated Linux port requires glibc 2.35 or newer in the target environment and at runtime. Older glibc and musl users need an overlay port.